		"en": [
			"Athrun's favorite machine is turned into a kit by BB Senshi! Completely reproduces the deformation of the back backpack. Separation and combination of backpacks can be reproduced. It is also possible to deploy the lifter with the wings folded. Equipped with the same type of Seal and beam rifle as Freedom Gundam."
